{"ID":"20240504161423-w7fop6a","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161423-w7fop6a","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161423-w7fop6a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504163525-lh0qg3l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617102242-l05swqv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504163525-xhssvfj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"097柏实（柏子仁）","type":"doc","updated":"20240620144408"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504163525-lh0qg3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163525-lh0qg3l","updated":"20240504163525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"柏子仁"}]},{"ID":"20240504163525-ixy3f0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163525-ixy3f0m","updated":"20240504163525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河北、山东、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t长卵形或长椭圆形，长0.30.7cm，直径0.10.3cm。新货黄白色或淡黄色，久置陈货则呈黄棕色，并有油点渗出。种仁外面常包有薄膜质的种皮，顶端略尖，圆三棱形，基部钝圆。质软油润，断面黄白色，胚乳较多，子叶2枚，均含丰富的油质。气微香，味淡而有油腻感。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t养心安神，润肠通便。用于虚烦不眠，心悸怔忡，肠燥便秘等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240504163525-opqxqpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163525-opqxqpb","updated":"20240504163525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093949-at1egjb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240504163525-c11nte3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504163525-c11nte3","updated":"20240504163525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkT